      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-07-24T00:11:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can indeed use a land protected by Infinite Vitality as a cascade sink!</p><p>You can also, eg, target it with Powers which add Blight, or choose it as a land to Blight for certain Events or&nbsp;<span>France's Stage 2 Escalation effect</span><span>. It doesn't restrict in any way your ability to choose to add Blight to that land, merely what happens when you do.</span></p>",
